            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Development of Steamboats</strong><br>\nFulton is best known for his development of the steamboat. His most successful venture, the North River Steamboat of Clermont, made its maiden voyage in 1807, proving that steam-powered transportation was commercially viable.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Commercial Success and Challenges</strong><br>\nDespite initial skepticism, Fulton's steamboats soon became a commercial success, significantly reducing travel time on rivers. However, he faced challenges, including competition and legal battles over steamboat monopolies.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Impact on Commerce and Trade</strong><br>\nFulton's steamboats revolutionized commerce and trade by enabling more efficient and predictable river transport. This innovation greatly contributed to the economic expansion of the United States in the early 19th century.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
